    "text": "1 days ago JACKSONVILLE, Fla. – With the leaves soon to change color, pumpkin spice abundant and Halloween beckoning, the Jacksonville Jumbo Shrimp are inviting fans to their Fall Festival presented by Fun 4 First Coast Kids from 6-9 p.m. on Friday, October 16 at VyStar Ballpark. Admission is only $1 per person, with free parking available in Lot P. Read full article",
